      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 04 · Intake Triage\n**Input:** share the form link with stakeholders. Anyone can submit a request.\n\n**Rules** set the priority (impact + deadline). The **Intake Analyst** classifies it, estimates size, picks an owner from your routing table, spots duplicates, lists missing information and drafts a reply. The PM gets one approval email.\n\n**Guardrails:** priority by rules, not AI · duplicate check against the intake log · reply never promises a date · nothing logged or drafted before approval · audit log",
        "height": 352,
        "width": 880,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "e3b2bf75-29ff-495b-a829-f061cd247a05",
